{"id":"forecast-13","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-13/audio-1.mp3","model":"small","duration":373.27,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.74,"text":"Part 1. You will hear a man who runs a volunteer agency interviewing a woman called Grace who","words":[["Part",0.0,0.36],["1.",0.36,0.8],["You",1.86,2.08],["will",2.08,2.26],["hear",2.26,2.46],["a",2.46,2.62],["man",2.62,2.94],["who",2.94,3.26],["runs",3.26,3.54],["a",3.54,3.74],["volunteer",3.74,4.14],["agency",4.14,4.94],["interviewing",4.94,5.46],["a",5.46,5.88],["woman",5.88,6.16],["called",6.16,6.68],["Grace",6.68,7.08],["who",7.08,7.74]]},{"start":7.74,"end":14.36,"text":"is applying to do volunteer work. First, you have some time to look at questions one to five.","words":[["is",7.74,7.9],["applying",7.9,8.26],["to",8.26,8.58],["do",8.58,8.78],["volunteer",8.78,9.24],["work.",9.24,9.84],["First,",10.72,11.26],["you",11.44,11.5],["have",11.5,11.66],["some",11.66,11.84],["time",11.84,12.24],["to",12.24,12.52],["look",12.52,12.66],["at",12.66,12.82],["questions",12.82,13.26],["one",13.26,13.74],["to",13.74,13.94],["five.",13.94,14.36]]},{"start":39.82,"end":43.46,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to five.","words":[["Now",39.82,40.18],["listen",40.18,40.52],["carefully",40.52,41.0],["and",41.0,41.36],["answer",41.36,41.76],["questions",41.76,42.26],["one",42.26,42.78],["to",42.78,42.96],["five.",42.96,43.46]]},{"start":47.07,"end":52.83,"text":"Hello, Grace. I'm William. Thanks for coming in for this interview. It's very important for","words":[["Hello,",47.07,47.47],["Grace.",47.57,47.81],["I'm",48.45,48.71],["William.",48.71,48.95],["Thanks",49.73,50.07],["for",50.07,50.27],["coming",50.27,50.43],["in",50.43,50.65],["for",50.65,50.79],["this",50.79,51.01],["interview.",51.01,51.45],["It's",51.71,51.83],["very",51.83,52.13],["important",52.13,52.55],["for",52.55,52.83]]},{"start":52.83,"end":57.53,"text":"us to meet our volunteers in person. I understand. It's no problem at all.","words":[["us",52.83,52.97],["to",52.97,53.15],["meet",53.15,53.25],["our",53.25,53.41],["volunteers",53.41,53.93],["in",53.93,54.35],["person.",54.35,54.73],["I",55.13,55.39],["understand.",55.39,55.89],["It's",56.39,56.63],["no",56.63,56.79],["problem",56.79,57.11],["at",57.11,57.29],["all.",57.29,57.53]]},{"start":58.23,"end":63.31,"text":"Okay. Let's get started. What's the best phone number to contact you on?","words":[["Okay.",58.23,58.55],["Let's",59.15,59.61],["get",59.61,59.71],["started.",59.71,60.05],["What's",60.79,61.33],["the",61.33,61.45],["best",61.45,61.69],["phone",61.69,62.13],["number",62.13,62.43],["to",62.43,62.55],["contact",62.55,62.89],["you",62.89,63.19],["on?",63.19,63.31]]},{"start":63.91,"end":75.19,"text":"My mobile phone's probably best. The numbers 021 636 7189. But I can't always answer it","words":[["My",63.91,64.27],["mobile",64.27,64.73],["phone's",64.73,65.27],["probably",65.27,65.63],["best.",65.63,66.03],["The",66.91,67.07],["numbers",67.07,67.51],["021",67.51,68.71],["636",68.71,70.23],["7189.",70.23,72.31],["But",73.11,73.79],["I",73.79,73.93],["can't",73.93,74.29],["always",74.29,74.59],["answer",74.59,74.95],["it",74.95,75.19]]},{"start":75.19,"end":80.35,"text":"during the day. I'll give you my email address as well. I check it frequently.","words":[["during",75.19,75.35],["the",75.35,75.55],["day.",75.55,75.87],["I'll",76.49,77.11],["give",77.11,77.25],["you",77.25,77.43],["my",77.43,77.61],["email",77.61,77.95],["address",77.95,78.39],["as",78.39,78.63],["well.",78.63,78.91],["I",79.37,79.55],["check",79.55,79.77],["it",79.77,79.91],["frequently.",79.91,80.35]]},{"start":80.35,"end":85.87,"text":"Okay. I'll make a note that email is a good way to contact you. What's the address?","words":[["Okay.",80.35,81.35],["I'll",81.87,82.15],["make",82.15,82.33],["a",82.33,82.43],["note",82.43,82.61],["that",82.61,82.77],["email",82.77,83.05],["is",83.05,83.33],["a",83.33,83.43],["good",83.43,83.53],["way",83.53,83.73],["to",83.73,83.85],["contact",83.85,84.19],["you.",84.19,84.55],["What's",85.13,85.47],["the",85.47,85.57],["address?",85.57,85.87]]},{"start":86.53,"end":96.51,"text":"It's Grace B at travel.co.nz. I chose it when I was younger and I just haven't changed it since.","words":[["It's",86.53,86.97],["Grace",86.97,87.45],["B",87.45,87.95],["at",87.95,88.55],["travel",88.55,89.03],[".co",89.03,90.05],[".nz.",90.05,91.21],["I",92.35,92.91],["chose",92.91,93.19],["it",93.19,93.43],["when",93.43,93.61],["I",93.61,93.77],["was",93.77,93.89],["younger",93.89,94.17],["and",94.17,94.91],["I",94.91,95.15],["just",95.15,95.35],["haven't",95.35,95.69],["changed",95.69,96.07],["it",96.07,96.27],["since.",96.27,96.51]]},{"start":96.97,"end":101.43,"text":"It's easy to remember. Now do you have any particular qualifications, Grace?","words":[["It's",96.97,97.21],["easy",97.21,97.39],["to",97.39,97.53],["remember.",97.53,97.81],["Now",98.87,99.11],["do",99.11,99.27],["you",99.27,99.41],["have",99.41,99.59],["any",99.59,99.77],["particular",99.77,100.27],["qualifications,",100.27,100.93],["Grace?",101.25,101.43]]},{"start":102.05,"end":109.97,"text":"I'm a housewife now but I used to be in teaching. I trained for that and got my diploma although I haven't done it for years.","words":[["I'm",102.05,102.33],["a",102.33,102.41],["housewife",102.41,102.91],["now",102.91,103.25],["but",103.25,103.91],["I",103.91,104.07],["used",104.07,104.31],["to",104.31,104.47],["be",104.47,104.59],["in",104.59,104.71],["teaching.",104.71,105.03],["I",105.65,105.97],["trained",105.97,106.29],["for",106.29,106.53],["that",106.53,106.71],["and",106.71,106.97],["got",106.97,107.19],["my",107.19,107.35],["diploma",107.35,107.83],["although",107.83,108.53],["I",108.53,108.91],["haven't",108.91,109.19],["done",109.19,109.37],["it",109.37,109.47],["for",109.47,109.63],["years.",109.63,109.97]]},{"start":110.63,"end":113.53,"text":"Before having children, I worked as a bank teller.","words":[["Before",110.63,111.15],["having",111.15,111.49],["children,",111.49,111.89],["I",112.21,112.37],["worked",112.37,112.61],["as",112.61,112.79],["a",112.79,112.91],["bank",112.91,113.07],["teller.",113.07,113.53]]},{"start":113.87,"end":117.65,"text":"All right. I need to find out when you'll be available during the week.","words":[["All",113.87,114.11],["right.",114.11,114.33],["I",114.91,115.25],["need",115.25,115.41],["to",115.41,115.57],["find",115.57,115.75],["out",115.75,115.95],["when",115.95,116.13],["you'll",116.13,116.37],["be",116.37,116.49],["available",116.49,116.89],["during",116.89,117.25],["the",117.25,117.43],["week.",117.43,117.65]]},{"start":118.29,"end":120.77,"text":"You said you have children. Are they at school?","words":[["You",118.29,118.47],["said",118.47,118.61],["you",118.61,118.75],["have",118.75,118.91],["children.",118.91,119.29],["Are",120.15,120.31],["they",120.31,120.41],["at",120.41,120.51],["school?",120.51,120.77]]},{"start":121.21,"end":126.85,"text":"Yes, both of them are. So I can't start work before 8.15 in the morning","words":[["Yes,",121.21,121.51],["both",121.91,122.21],["of",122.21,122.37],["them",122.37,122.55],["are.",122.55,122.73],["So",123.33,123.63],["I",123.63,123.87],["can't",123.87,124.25],["start",124.25,124.51],["work",124.51,124.85],["before",124.85,125.27],["8",125.27,125.69],[".15",125.69,126.09],["in",126.09,126.39],["the",126.39,126.47],["morning",126.47,126.85]]},{"start":126.85,"end":129.75,"text":"or work past three o'clock in the afternoon.","words":[["or",126.85,127.61],["work",127.61,127.93],["past",127.93,128.27],["three",128.27,128.67],["o",128.67,128.83],["'clock",128.83,128.99],["in",128.99,129.13],["the",129.13,129.23],["afternoon.",129.23,129.75]]},{"start":130.37,"end":136.49,"text":"So you'd be looking for about four or five hours a day, say 9.15am to 2pm?","words":[["So",130.37,130.87],["you'd",130.87,131.05],["be",131.05,131.15],["looking",131.15,131.35],["for",131.35,131.55],["about",131.55,131.77],["four",131.77,132.19],["or",132.19,132.33],["five",132.33,132.57],["hours",132.57,132.89],["a",132.89,133.05],["day,",133.05,133.35],["say",133.63,133.85],["9",133.85,134.51],[".15am",134.51,135.41],["to",135.41,135.69],["2pm?",135.69,136.49]]},{"start":136.49,"end":141.69,"text":"that gives you time to get to and from school to work that's perfect it's","words":[["that",136.49,137.45],["gives",137.45,137.67],["you",137.67,137.79],["time",137.79,138.01],["to",138.01,138.15],["get",138.15,138.29],["to",138.29,138.55],["and",138.55,138.67],["from",138.67,138.87],["school",138.87,139.29],["to",139.29,139.49],["work",139.49,139.75],["that's",139.75,140.33],["perfect",140.33,140.75],["it's",140.75,141.69]]},{"start":141.69,"end":146.05,"text":"important for me to be there for my children of course and are you looking","words":[["important",141.69,142.07],["for",142.07,142.37],["me",142.37,142.49],["to",142.49,142.65],["be",142.65,142.83],["there",142.83,143.07],["for",143.07,143.21],["my",143.21,143.35],["children",143.35,143.71],["of",143.71,144.17],["course",144.17,144.51],["and",144.51,145.59],["are",145.59,145.75],["you",145.75,145.85],["looking",145.85,146.05]]},{"start":146.05,"end":151.81,"text":"to work Monday to Friday yes if it gets to be too much I can rethink it later now","words":[["to",146.05,146.23],["work",146.23,146.41],["Monday",146.41,146.69],["to",146.69,146.93],["Friday",146.93,147.13],["yes",147.13,147.97],["if",147.97,148.65],["it",148.65,148.75],["gets",148.75,148.95],["to",148.95,149.13],["be",149.13,149.25],["too",149.25,149.43],["much",149.43,149.65],["I",149.65,150.03],["can",150.03,150.23],["rethink",150.23,150.51],["it",150.51,150.77],["later",150.77,151.03],["now",151.03,151.81]]},{"start":151.81,"end":156.41,"text":"Grace you obviously have a lot of work experience but have you done any volunteer","words":[["Grace",151.81,152.35],["you",152.35,153.05],["obviously",153.05,153.41],["have",153.41,153.73],["a",153.73,153.83],["lot",153.83,153.95],["of",153.95,154.07],["work",154.07,154.27],["experience",154.27,154.87],["but",154.87,155.35],["have",155.35,155.55],["you",155.55,155.63],["done",155.63,155.81],["any",155.81,155.99],["volunteer",155.99,156.41]]},{"start":156.41,"end":162.77,"text":"work before during the Rugby World Cup there were many visitors who didn't","words":[["work",156.41,156.77],["before",156.77,157.07],["during",157.07,159.11],["the",159.11,159.57],["Rugby",159.57,159.91],["World",159.91,160.09],["Cup",160.09,160.41],["there",160.41,161.23],["were",161.23,161.39],["many",161.39,161.65],["visitors",161.65,162.03],["who",162.03,162.43],["didn't",162.43,162.77]]},{"start":162.77,"end":168.37,"text":"know their way around or what they should see and do in Auckland City. So I worked as a","words":[["know",162.77,162.95],["their",162.95,163.13],["way",163.13,163.33],["around",163.33,163.87],["or",163.87,164.47],["what",164.47,164.73],["they",164.73,164.99],["should",164.99,165.19],["see",165.19,165.51],["and",165.51,165.67],["do",165.67,165.89],["in",165.89,166.01],["Auckland",166.01,166.21],["City.",166.21,166.59],["So",167.19,167.51],["I",167.51,167.77],["worked",167.77,168.03],["as",168.03,168.25],["a",168.25,168.37]]},{"start":168.37,"end":172.33,"text":"guide to help introduce the city to tourists. I really enjoyed it.","words":[["guide",168.37,168.69],["to",168.69,168.91],["help",168.91,169.13],["introduce",169.13,169.59],["the",169.59,169.93],["city",169.93,170.13],["to",170.13,170.33],["tourists.",170.33,170.75],["I",171.29,171.43],["really",171.43,171.67],["enjoyed",171.67,172.05],["it.",172.05,172.33]]},{"start":172.75,"end":179.59,"text":"OK, good. Have you done anything else? Perhaps when you were at school or university, did","words":[["OK,",172.75,172.99],["good.",173.31,173.53],["Have",174.33,174.53],["you",174.53,174.61],["done",174.61,174.81],["anything",174.81,175.07],["else?",175.07,175.33],["Perhaps",176.25,176.59],["when",176.59,176.87],["you",176.87,177.03],["were",177.03,177.13],["at",177.13,177.23],["school",177.23,177.55],["or",177.55,177.95],["university,",177.95,178.55],["did",179.41,179.59]]},{"start":179.59,"end":184.29,"text":"you do any volunteer work there? When I was at university, the manager of","words":[["you",179.59,179.71],["do",179.71,179.83],["any",179.83,179.95],["volunteer",179.95,180.35],["work",180.35,180.65],["there?",180.65,180.95],["When",181.57,181.81],["I",181.81,182.05],["was",182.05,182.19],["at",182.19,182.31],["university,",182.31,182.85],["the",183.49,183.65],["manager",183.65,184.03],["of",184.03,184.29]]},{"start":184.29,"end":187.49,"text":"a netball team asked me to be the coach and I did that.","words":[["a",184.29,184.41],["netball",184.41,184.77],["team",184.77,185.05],["asked",185.05,185.43],["me",185.43,185.63],["to",185.63,185.79],["be",185.79,185.97],["the",185.97,186.11],["coach",186.11,186.41],["and",186.41,186.87],["I",186.87,187.07],["did",187.07,187.21],["that.",187.21,187.49]]},{"start":187.85,"end":190.33,"text":"Great. It sounds like you like your sports.","words":[["Great.",187.85,188.09],["It",188.85,189.01],["sounds",189.01,189.15],["like",189.15,189.37],["you",189.37,189.53],["like",189.53,189.75],["your",189.75,189.93],["sports.",189.93,190.33]]},{"start":190.33,"end":192.37,"text":"I used to, but not so much nowadays.","words":[["I",190.33,190.81],["used",190.81,191.15],["to,",191.15,191.35],["but",191.45,191.55],["not",191.55,191.75],["so",191.75,191.93],["much",191.93,192.11],["nowadays.",192.11,192.37]]},{"start":193.11,"end":193.35,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",193.11,193.35]]},{"start":196.88,"end":202.86,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 6-10.","words":[["Before",196.88,197.3],["you",197.3,197.58],["hear",197.58,197.86],["the",197.86,198.04],["rest",198.04,198.34],["of",198.34,198.44],["the",198.44,198.54],["conversation,",198.54,199.16],["you",199.8,200.02],["have",200.02,200.22],["some",200.22,200.4],["time",200.4,200.86],["to",200.86,201.12],["look",201.12,201.24],["at",201.24,201.4],["questions",201.4,201.78],["6",201.78,202.36],["-10.",202.36,202.86]]},{"start":228.36,"end":231.48,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 6-10.","words":[["Now",228.36,228.62],["listen",228.62,228.92],["and",228.92,229.32],["answer",229.32,229.78],["questions",229.78,230.2],["6",230.2,230.92],["-10.",230.92,231.48]]},{"start":234.87,"end":237.17,"text":"If not sports, do you have any other interests?","words":[["If",234.87,235.23],["not",235.23,235.39],["sports,",235.39,235.83],["do",236.07,236.19],["you",236.19,236.29],["have",236.29,236.43],["any",236.43,236.59],["other",236.59,236.77],["interests?",236.77,237.17]]},{"start":237.59,"end":238.11,"text":"Oh yes.","words":[["Oh",237.59,237.83],["yes.",237.83,238.11]]},{"start":238.67,"end":242.51,"text":"I love to get out in my garden, and I grow most of my own vegetables.","words":[["I",238.67,238.89],["love",238.89,239.13],["to",239.13,239.31],["get",239.31,239.45],["out",239.45,239.65],["in",239.65,239.79],["my",239.79,239.95],["garden,",239.95,240.39],["and",240.65,240.95],["I",240.95,241.07],["grow",241.07,241.23],["most",241.23,241.61],["of",241.61,241.77],["my",241.77,241.93],["own",241.93,242.07],["vegetables.",242.07,242.51]]},{"start":243.23,"end":248.29,"text":"I love flowers and flower arranging, but I don't suppose there's much volunteer work","words":[["I",243.23,243.43],["love",243.43,243.69],["flowers",243.69,244.21],["and",244.21,244.41],["flower",244.41,244.73],["arranging,",244.73,245.31],["but",245.63,246.25],["I",246.25,246.45],["don't",246.45,246.61],["suppose",246.61,246.95],["there's",246.95,247.23],["much",247.23,247.49],["volunteer",247.49,247.93],["work",247.93,248.29]]},{"start":248.29,"end":252.89,"text":"associated with those kinds of things. You'd be surprised. Any other hobbies?","words":[["associated",248.29,248.79],["with",248.79,249.15],["those",249.15,249.37],["kinds",249.37,249.59],["of",249.59,249.81],["things.",249.81,250.09],["You'd",250.41,250.73],["be",250.73,250.89],["surprised.",250.89,251.37],["Any",252.15,252.39],["other",252.39,252.61],["hobbies?",252.61,252.89]]},{"start":253.49,"end":260.35,"text":"Like most people, I guess. I like music. Actually, I can play the guitar, but I haven't done much","words":[["Like",253.49,253.73],["most",253.73,253.99],["people,",253.99,254.29],["I",254.45,254.49],["guess.",254.49,254.73],["I",255.01,255.09],["like",255.09,255.27],["music.",255.27,255.69],["Actually,",256.69,257.15],["I",257.37,257.53],["can",257.53,257.77],["play",257.77,258.03],["the",258.03,258.17],["guitar,",258.17,258.55],["but",258.93,259.31],["I",259.31,259.55],["haven't",259.55,259.89],["done",259.89,260.03],["much",260.03,260.35]]},{"start":260.35,"end":265.23,"text":"for a while, so I'm a bit rusty. One day, I'd like to have a go at the flute.","words":[["for",260.35,260.49],["a",260.49,260.59],["while,",260.59,260.79],["so",260.89,261.11],["I'm",261.11,261.45],["a",261.45,261.51],["bit",261.51,261.67],["rusty.",261.67,261.97],["One",262.85,263.23],["day,",263.23,263.45],["I'd",263.63,263.83],["like",263.83,264.03],["to",264.03,264.21],["have",264.21,264.35],["a",264.35,264.47],["go",264.47,264.63],["at",264.63,264.77],["the",264.77,264.89],["flute.",264.89,265.23]]},{"start":266.39,"end":272.65,"text":"Okay. That gives me a good idea of the type of work you might be interested in. Ideally,","words":[["Okay.",266.39,266.87],["That",267.57,267.87],["gives",267.87,268.11],["me",268.11,268.25],["a",268.25,268.37],["good",268.37,268.65],["idea",268.65,269.03],["of",269.03,269.25],["the",269.25,269.37],["type",269.37,269.77],["of",269.77,269.91],["work",269.91,270.13],["you",270.13,270.33],["might",270.33,270.47],["be",270.47,270.63],["interested",270.63,271.01],["in.",271.01,271.27],["Ideally,",272.19,272.65]]},{"start":272.95,"end":278.09,"text":"it'd be something that combines your experience and your hobbies. If you're interested","words":[["it'd",272.95,273.11],