294.21],["or",294.21,294.39],["the",294.39,294.51],["heat.",294.51,294.77]]},{"start":295.71,"end":299.11,"text":"In the past we've had many positions working in community centres.","words":[["In",295.71,295.95],["the",295.95,296.03],["past",296.03,296.31],["we've",296.31,296.63],["had",296.63,296.77],["many",296.77,297.09],["positions",297.09,297.41],["working",297.41,297.87],["in",297.87,298.17],["community",298.17,298.59],["centres.",298.59,299.11]]},{"start":300.07,"end":305.21,"text":"They've been working with the disabled or teens. The position we have available now","words":[["They've",300.07,300.33],["been",300.33,300.43],["working",300.43,300.71],["with",300.71,300.95],["the",300.95,301.09],["disabled",301.09,301.61],["or",301.61,301.95],["teens.",301.95,302.31],["The",303.29,303.65],["position",303.65,303.97],["we",303.97,304.19],["have",304.19,304.39],["available",304.39,304.73],["now",304.73,305.21]]},{"start":305.21,"end":310.97,"text":"is with elderly men and women. They have activities like flower arranging, music","words":[["is",305.21,305.47],["with",305.47,305.65],["elderly",305.65,306.21],["men",306.21,306.55],["and",306.55,306.85],["women.",306.85,307.09],["They",307.71,308.23],["have",308.23,308.41],["activities",308.41,308.83],["like",308.83,309.23],["flower",309.23,309.67],["arranging,",309.67,310.29],["music",310.73,310.97]]},{"start":310.97,"end":316.33,"text":"lessons, sing-alongs, things like that. Both of those sound great. I'm really open","words":[["lessons,",310.97,311.43],["sing",311.83,311.95],["-alongs,",311.95,312.31],["things",312.71,312.91],["like",312.91,313.15],["that.",313.15,313.43],["Both",313.81,314.05],["of",314.05,314.19],["those",314.19,314.37],["sound",314.37,314.65],["great.",314.65,314.99],["I'm",315.53,315.79],["really",315.79,316.03],["open",316.03,316.33]]},{"start":316.33,"end":322.21,"text":"to anything. That's nice to know. Just a couple more questions. Why do you want to","words":[["to",316.33,316.51],["anything.",316.51,316.85],["That's",317.45,317.71],["nice",317.71,317.91],["to",317.91,318.09],["know.",318.09,318.29],["Just",319.11,319.63],["a",319.63,319.79],["couple",319.79,319.95],["more",319.95,320.21],["questions.",320.21,320.67],["Why",321.55,321.77],["do",321.77,321.87],["you",321.87,321.93],["want",321.93,322.07],["to",322.07,322.21]]},{"start":322.21,"end":327.83,"text":"do volunteer work? Well now that both my children are in school I'd like to make","words":[["do",322.21,322.37],["volunteer",322.37,322.79],["work?",322.79,323.17],["Well",323.67,324.03],["now",324.03,324.83],["that",324.83,324.99],["both",324.99,325.19],["my",325.19,325.43],["children",325.43,325.75],["are",325.75,325.97],["in",325.97,326.09],["school",326.09,326.43],["I'd",326.43,327.29],["like",327.29,327.49],["to",327.49,327.69],["make",327.69,327.83]]},{"start":327.83,"end":332.53,"text":"some friends as I've got the time on my hands. Also I like the idea of","words":[["some",327.83,328.05],["friends",328.05,328.47],["as",328.47,328.77],["I've",328.77,329.01],["got",329.01,329.15],["the",329.15,329.27],["time",329.27,329.57],["on",329.57,329.69],["my",329.69,329.87],["hands.",329.87,330.19],["Also",330.75,331.25],["I",331.25,331.63],["like",331.63,331.85],["the",331.85,332.03],["idea",332.03,332.31],["of",332.31,332.53]]},{"start":332.53,"end":338.21,"text":"helping others. And last question, how did you find our agency? We aren't in the","words":[["helping",332.53,332.81],["others.",332.81,333.13],["And",333.95,334.21],["last",334.21,334.47],["question,",334.47,334.89],["how",335.59,335.83],["did",335.83,335.91],["you",335.91,336.05],["find",336.05,336.33],["our",336.33,336.61],["agency?",336.61,337.05],["We",337.69,337.85],["aren't",337.85,338.03],["in",338.03,338.13],["the",338.13,338.21]]},{"start":338.21,"end":343.39,"text":"phone book. Did a friend tell you about us? No, I was on my way to school the","words":[["phone",338.21,338.41],["book.",338.41,338.69],["Did",339.47,339.69],["a",339.69,339.79],["friend",339.79,339.95],["tell",339.95,340.23],["you",340.23,340.39],["about",340.39,340.55],["us?",340.55,340.81],["No,",341.13,341.39],["I",341.69,341.99],["was",341.99,342.19],["on",342.19,342.39],["my",342.39,342.57],["way",342.57,342.77],["to",342.77,342.89],["school",342.89,343.17],["the",343.17,343.39]]},{"start":343.39,"end":347.91,"text":"other day and I saw your advertisement at the supermarket. It's good to know","words":[["other",343.39,343.53],["day",343.53,343.87],["and",343.87,344.43],["I",344.43,344.61],["saw",344.61,344.85],["your",344.85,345.07],["advertisement",345.07,345.55],["at",345.55,345.87],["the",345.87,345.97],["supermarket.",345.97,346.27],["It's",347.19,347.51],["good",347.51,347.61],["to",347.61,347.77],["know",347.77,347.91]]},{"start":347.91,"end":357.89,"text":"someone sees those ads. Thank you again. That is the end of part one. You now","words":[["someone",347.91,348.25],["sees",348.25,348.49],["those",348.49,348.73],["ads.",348.73,349.05],["Thank",349.89,350.13],["you",350.13,350.31],["again.",350.31,350.63],["That",354.45,354.99],["is",354.99,355.19],["the",355.19,355.37],["end",355.37,355.77],["of",355.77,355.93],["part",355.93,356.13],["one.",356.13,356.53],["You",357.21,357.59],["now",357.59,357.89]]},{"start":357.89,"end":361.05,"text":"have one minute to check your answers to part one.","words":[["have",357.89,358.23],["one",358.23,358.53],["minute",358.53,358.93],["to",358.93,359.19],["check",359.19,359.51],["your",359.51,359.73],["answers",359.73,360.15],["to",360.15,360.43],["part",360.43,360.63],["one.",360.63,361.05]]}]}